This is my graduation project. Please give me your valuable feedback.
  The design was carried out using the SDK of Xunwei RK3568. For the time being, the local OTA upgrade method was adopted. A lighttpd server was deployed, and an overall 
architecture combining RESTful and CGI was adopted. 
  A simple voice interaction module was also integrated. The project implemented a simple web-based smart home terminal, integrating private cloud storage, family photo 
album, furniture control demo, Wi-Fi function, Grok internal network penetration function, as well as weather information and indoor temperature/humidity display functions. 
  The weather query function adopts the method of Weifeng Weather + API, and the indoor temperature and humidity are measured using the locally connected DHT11 sensor. 
As for the control functions of the home appliances, the Zigbee module was used for simulation. 
  Users can simply control their home appliances through the voice module and obtain information such as weather, temperature and humidity. 
They can also log in to the web interface to control it.

这是我的毕业设计。请给我宝贵的意见。
该设计是使用迅为 RK3568 的 SDK 实现的。目前采用的是本地 OTA 升级方法。部署了一个 lighttpd 服务器，并采用了结合了 RESTful 和 CGI 的整体架构。
还集成了一个简单的语音交互模块。该项目实现了一个简单的基于网络的智能家居终端，整合了私有云存储、家庭照片相册、家具控制演示、Wi-Fi 功能、Grok 内部网络穿透功能以及天气信息和室内温度/湿度显示功能。
天气查询功能采用的是微风天气 + API 的方法，室内温度和湿度则通过本地连接的 DHT11 传感器进行测量。
对于家用电器的控制功能，使用了 Zigbee 模块进行模拟。
用户可以通过语音模块简单地控制他们的家用电器，并获取诸如天气、温度和湿度等信息。他们还可以登录到网络界面进行控制。

